    <data key="d0">Equifax: Multi-Region High-Reliability Architecture with EKS and Spot Instances</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Architecture for myequifax.com utilizing EKS on EC2 on-demand and spot instances connecting to Aurora Global and Document Storage.</data>
